  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Carnival 2013 Spring, the last Battle Carnival, was held at Fukuoka International Congress Center on 4 May, Nagoya's Fukiage Hall on 12 May, Makuhari Messe in Chiba on 18 and 19 May and Intex Osaka on 26 May 2013. Its World Challenge Tournament had an A League for players born in 2002 or later and a B League for older players, with invitations to the 2013 World Championships in Vancouver at stake, and everyone who entered got Mew stamped with the event's logo. The Challenge Stage now took four straight wins and the Premier Stage was played in four-player knockouts. The top three of each league in the Climax Stage won Victory Cup in the print for their place and an alternate-art Mewtwo-EX stamped with the event's logo.",
